Package: ShuttleboxR
Title: Data Preparation and Exploration for Shuttle-Box Temperature Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9004
Authors@R: 
    person("Pieter", "Riesenkamp", , "p.b.riesenkamp@student.rug.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a structured workflow for importing and organising
    ShuttleSoft temperature shuttle-box data, calculating reproducible thermal
    and behavioural metrics, and inspecting single trials and complete projects
    before statistical analysis. Project-level tools help flag unusual trials
    for closer inspection without treating outlier status as an automatic basis
    for exclusion.
